{"data":{"id":1400627895,"totalResults":93,"items":[{"quote":"Elden Ring is the real next step for souls-like standards. It is unlike anything FromSoftware has created before, displaying an uncanny world that will keep on wowing players even as they pile up more and more hours of gameplay. Elden Ring is, thus, a prime candidate to become the 2022 GOTY.\r\n","score":100,"url":"https://areajugones.sport.es/videojuegos/analisis-elden-ring-la-mesa-redonda-tiene-nuevo-rey-arturo/","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"Areajugones","publicationSlug":"areajugones","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400627895,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":96},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400627895,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"}}},"platform":"PlayStation 5"},{"quote":"Elden Ring is a crowning achievement of over a decade of Miyazaki’s and FromSoftware’s work, and an amazing example of how to find a whole new level of fun in a well-known and somewhat worn-out formula. The open world turned out to be a perfect fit for the genre and you can still tell this masterpiece was created by the famous Japanese studio. I honestly haven’t been so excited about a game since the first Dark Souls.","score":100,"url":"https://cdaction.pl/recenzje/recenzja-elden-ring-to-nie-jest-dark-souls-iv-to-cos-znacznie-wiecej","date":"2022-02-23","author":"","authorSlug":null,"image":null,"publicationName":"CD-Action","publicationSlug":"cd-action","reviewedProduct":{"id":1400627895,"type":"games","title":"Elden Ring","url":"/game/elden-ring/","criticScoreSummary":{"url":"/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5","score":96},"platform":{"id":1500000062,"name":"PlayStation 5"},"gameTaxonomy":{"game":{"id":1400627895,"name":"Elden Ring"},"platform":{"id":150